      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Current year distributions were $130,420,000 which exceeded unappropriated retained income by $13,885,282 as of December 31, 2025. Such excess was recorded against additional paid-in capital.</xhtml:p>
