      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Explanatory Remarks</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>Diamond Pipeline LLC is managed by its Members, who act through a Board. Each Member appoints two Board Members to act on its behalf.</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>The Board Members are listed on page 105.</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>The Board may designate and appoint one or more persons to serve as Officers of the Company with the authority to perform such duties as delegated by the Board.</xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p>The Designated Officers are listed on page 104.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
